  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to be able to add any variable to SendCustomNetworkEvent as an argument and send it at the same time.\nIf even one argument can be sent at the same time, the creator will not have to prepare a large number of functions with sequentially numbered names, saving many lines of code.\nFor example:\npublic class Receiver : UdonSharpBehaviour\n{\n    public void FunctionWithInt(int intArg)\n    {\n        Debug.Log(intArg)\n    }\n}\npublic class Sender : UdonSharpBehaviour\n{\n    // Receiver object is set from inspector\n    public Receiver receiver;\n    void Start()\n    {\n        receiver.SendCustomNetworkEvent(VRC.Udon.Common.Interfaces.NetworkEventTarget.All, nameof(receiver.FunctionWithInt));\n    }\n}",
